/* Hallmark · shape: app screen · genre: modern-minimal · theme: brand (voidHTTP's system, by owner request 2026-11-16)
 * paper: #ffffff on canvas #f0f4fa · accent: #2e67e5 · display: --font-ui · body: --font-ui · table: --font-table · console: --font-mono (all user-configurable) · icons: Lucide
 * nav: title strip of connection tabs, icon rail (Schema, History, Saved) + panel, voidHTTP's shell · signature: the result grid under the query line, engine and database in one filled field beside Run · states: empty, loading, error, full
 * axes: light/grotesk-sans/cool · posture: restrained · contrast: pass · v2.0.0
 * source: voidHTTP src/styles.css rules copied as they are (marked by section); ypacapy's own rules are the last block */
/* Hallmark · pre-emit critique: P4 H4 E4 S3 R5 V3 · weakest: S, the look is voidHTTP's by request; the query line, the engine label and the column types under each grid head keep it a database tool */
/* Hallmark · owner decision: soft field edges (--color-edge-soft, about 1.3:1), inherited from voidHTTP; Floor 40 stays open and is reported, --color-edge-aa (3:1) is kept for a future setting */
/* Hallmark · dismissed F4 · Run is the one filled primary button; the filled new-query plus and the filled mode chips are voidHTTP's selection and icon states, not a second call to action */
/* Hallmark · waive 24b · .tab-add and .side-toggle margin 2.5px is an optical offset, not spacing · it puts their 32px buttons on the centre line of the tab icons, measured 18.5px up from the bar's foot (18.5 - 16); 2.5px is 5 device pixels on a 2x screen */
/* Hallmark · waive 39b · .seg button is 24px inside the 28px Rows and Structure switch of the results toolbar · voidHTTP's compact view switch, kept the same size here */
/* Hallmark · dismissed 3 · the 3px rule on the vertical .divider is its drag grip, voidHTTP's side-by-side divider, not a card stripe */
/* Hallmark · dismissed 23 · .side-resize::after is a 3px line along the sidebar edge while dragged, far under 5% of the window */
/* Hallmark · dismissed F1 · the straight quotes in table.html sit inside jsonb cells and the SQL, as the database returned them; typographic quotes would change the value */
@import url("./tokens.css");
@import url("./base.css");

